                                        text="&lt;ol>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Silva ABG, Pestana BC, Hirahata FAA, et al. Parkinson’s Disease: literature review. Brazilian Journal of Development. 2021;7(5):47677-47698;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Dauer W, Przedborski S. Parkinson’s Disease: Mechanisms and Models. Neuron. 2003;39(6):889-909;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Schapira AHV, Chaudhuri KR, Jenner P. Non-motor features of Parkinson disease. Nat Rev Neurosci. 2017;18(7):435-450.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>CHAUDHURI, K.; ODIN, P.; LINDVALL, S. et al. Quantifying the incremental economic burden of advanced Parkinson's disease: real-world Evidence from EU5 countries. 7th Congress of the European Academy of Neurology 2021, v. 28, suppl. 1, p. 135, 2021.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>SHIH, T. M.; SAIL, K. R.; JALUNDHWALA, Y. J. et al. The effect of functional status impairment on nursing home admission risk among patients with advanced Parkinson's disease. Journal of Medical Economics, v. 23, n. 3, p. 297-307, 2020.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>KORCHOUNOV, S.; BOGOMAZOV, G. Employment, medical absenteeism, and disability perception in Parkinson's disease: A pilot double‐blind, randomized, placebo‐controlled study of entacapone adjunctive therapy. Movement Disorders, v. 21, n. 12, p. 2220-2224, 2006.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Migraine is first cause of disability in under 50s: will health politicians now take notice. Disponível em: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5821623/?sf263957915=1. Acesso em 22 de abril de 2026.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Classificação Internacional de Cefaleias – terceira edição (ICHD-3 beta) – Tradução portuguesa 2014. Disponível em: https://bit.ly/3lqm3DD. Acesso em 22 de abril de 2026.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Ostwald DA, et al. Socioeconomic burden of main diseases in eight Latin American countries: the case of Brazil. Prepared for FIFARMA. WifOR Institute, Germany, 2024.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa; Disponível em: https://fifarma.org/?jet_download=b0845e6c4329c4018e81a4a3d0b